Kounain hai qadmo'n pa rethi pa thikaana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>akbar pa nazar daalo qasim ki taraf dekho <br />
marne ke iraade hai jeene ka zamana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>shabbir ke hatho ka bosa to koi lele<br />
nanhe se mujaahid ko maidaan me laana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>dekha hi abhi kya hai dunya ki nigaaho ne<br />
rakh kar abhi haatho par dil apna dikhaana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Kousar ke ye maalik hai paani ki talab kaisi<br />
soi hui millat ki gheerat ko jagaana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>ummat ki mohabbat me bacho ko fida karke<br />
dunyaa-e-mohabbat ka qanoon banaana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>ye kis ne jhukaaya hai sar taa'ate qaaliq me<br />
kya sar hai ke sajde se qaatil ko uthaana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>ahmad ka nawasa hai meraaj bhi paayega<br />
naize ki bulandi se quraan sunaana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>lafzo'n se hukoomat ki bunyaad hilaani hai<br />
sajjad ko zaalim ke darbaar me jaana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Ab apne ghulaamo se shabbir ka pursa lei'n<br />
Ae saahebe gham aaja ek din tujhe aana hai<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>islaam ko deni hai har saal hayaate nao<br />
kya toone kaha ghaafil ye zikr puraana hai<br />
